    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "mkt_title",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 665,
      "width": 1260,
      "height": 32,
      "text": "Every story. Fresh context. Zero limits.",
      "originalText": "Every story. Fresh context. Zero limits.",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#1e40af",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 106010,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 106011,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [],
      "boundElements": null,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "mkt_body",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 703,
      "width": 1260,
      "height": 110,
      "text": "Rorca runs every user story as a fresh isolated subprocess — no context spillover between stories, no stale state, no limits.\nKV caching is active across all paths — each provider supports it natively, with Anthropic delivering the deepest savings (~90% on cached tokens).\nClaude Code uniquely adds persistent bash shell state across tool calls and surgical diff edits (~150 tokens vs ~3000 for full rewrites).\nOpenCode unlocks 75+ model choices with automatic complexity-tiered cascading — simple stories on faster models, complex ones on powerful ones — cutting costs 40-60%.\nAcross all paths, the Direction Stack (L1–L5) delivers your principles, conventions, spec brief, and story annotations to each subprocess.\nYour intent always travels with the agent.",
      "originalText": "Rorca runs every user story as a fresh isolated subprocess — no context spillover between stories, no stale state, no limits.\nKV caching is active across all paths — each provider supports it natively, with Anthropic delivering the deepest savings (~90% on cached tokens).\nClaude Code uniquely adds persistent bash shell state across tool calls and surgical diff edits (~150 tokens vs ~3000 for full rewrites).\nOpenCode unlocks 75+ model choices with automatic complexity-tiered cascading — simple stories on faster models, complex ones on powerful ones — cutting costs 40-60%.\nAcross all paths, the Direction Stack (L1–L5) delivers your principles, conventions, spec brief, and story annotations to each subprocess.\nYour intent always travels with the agent.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 106012,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 106013,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [],
      "boundElements": null,
      "link": null,
